{"4937720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oath Eternal", "steam_appid": 4937720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4957030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESCEND. LOOT. EXTRACT. REPEAT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oath Eternal is a dark fantasy RPG inspired by the Metroidvania and Extraction genres. Equip your character and delve into the dungeon, but be sure to extract with your hard-earned loot before being lost to the darkness. Become more powerful with each raid, pushing further into the dungeon to uncover the secrets of Castle Veynhold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Metroidvania-style dungeons which blend hand-crafted areas with procedural generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat challenging bosses and dangerous enemies in fast-paced 2D combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract with your hard-earned loot, or push deeper into the dungeon for more: the choice is yours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with unique classes, equipment, abilities, and passive skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with Merchants to trade items, complete quests, and enchant your equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate secret passages, hidden doors, puzzles, and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay dungeons with randomized layouts: no two runs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalate the challenge with Elite Mode, a New Game Plus experience</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESCEND. LOOT. EXTRACT. REPEAT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oath Eternal is a dark fantasy RPG inspired by the Metroidvania and Extraction genres. Equip your character and delve into the dungeon, but be sure to extract with your hard-earned loot before being lost to the darkness. Become more powerful with each raid, pushing further into the dungeon to uncover the secrets of Castle Veynhold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Metroidvania-style dungeons which blend hand-crafted areas with procedural generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat challenging bosses and dangerous enemies in fast-paced 2D combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract with your hard-earned loot, or push deeper into the dungeon for more: the choice is yours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with unique classes, equipment, abilities, and passive skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with Merchants to trade items, complete quests, and enchant your equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate secret passages, hidden doors, puzzles, and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay dungeons with randomized layouts: no two runs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalate the challenge with Elite Mode, a New Game Plus experience</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A dark fantasy RPG inspired by the Metroidvania and Extraction genres.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937720/88ad24517e473a8f97acee9926fdb01643c06894/header.jpg?t=1784661212", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937720/82f5d8644d788b26d0021222884178f7b774907b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784661212", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937720/82f5d8644d788b26d0021222884178f7b774907b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784661212", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=